# Build context for the cloud backend image (see Dockerfile).
#
# ⚠ The excludes below are not tidiness. Without them the context is several GB —
# `services/backend/.venv` alone is 1.1 GB, `storage/` 886 MB, `node_modules/` 505 MB — and the
# free-tier build either crawls or dies. Measured 2026-08-28.
#
# The image needs `services/backend/**` and nothing else: `runtime_paths.app_root()` resolves to
# the WORKDIR, and no backend module imports from `tools/`, `tests/` or `apps/`.

# Virtualenvs and Python build residue
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
*.egg-info

# Runtime state. Never bake someone's machine into an image — the same reasoning
# package-server.ps1 applies to the PyInstaller output.
storage/
services/storage/
services/backend/storage/
.env

# Frontend — not in the image at all
node_modules/
apps/
packages/
dist/
build/

# Repo furniture
.git/
.github/
docs/
tests/
tools/
scratch/
downloads/
_deprecated/
*.log
